  "description": "The note is at `./..../   /.. stowaway note.txt`. Spelled out: a directory named `....`\n(four dots), inside it a directory whose name is **three spaces**, and inside that a file named\n`.. stowaway note.txt` (it starts with two dots and a space).\n\nPrint the contents of the note, and nothing else.",
