  "story": "The office pantry logged every snack grabbed today in `snacks.log`, one per line.\nFinance wants totals. Finance also wants to know who keeps buying kale chips.",
  "description": "Count how many times each snack appears in `snacks.log`. Print one line per snack in the\nform `<count> <snack>`, sorted by count, highest first. (No two snacks share a count.)",
