  "description": "The wardrobe is this directory, one file per item. Everything that belongs to the queen has a\nname **starting** with `Hippolyta`, but the scribe who labeled it wasn't consistent: some names\nstart with `hippolyta` instead. Print the names of all of Hippolyta's things, one per line.\nOrder doesn't matter, and a leading `./` is fine.",
