  "story": "Welcome to the Great Feast at Maple Hollow Farm! Your host is Sir Gobbles the turkey:\nkernel of the feast, absolutely *not* the main course. He has a stack of blank name cards,\na very long table, and a strong opinion about alphabetical order.",
